  "notes": "Inputs 1 and 2 are front combo XLR/6.35 mm jacks (mic on XLR, line or instrument on jack via the Inst button). Inputs 3 and 4 are rear 6.35 mm jacks for line level. Line Outputs 1-2 are the main speaker outputs, 3-4 are extra outputs with the same electrical characteristics. MIDI In/Out are 5-pin DIN. The optional 5V DC USB-C power input and the Kensington lock are not listed. Routing: inputs reach the computer via USB and the outputs via direct monitoring / Focusrite Control 2 routing; computer playback reaches all outputs. Controls from the user guide, 'Front Panel': gain for inputs 1 and 2, 48V per input, INST, AIR, SAFE, main output level (outputs 1 and 2) and headphone level. The INST, AIR, SAFE and 48V buttons act on the input chosen with SELECT and are shown once per input; AUTO (Auto Gain) is a one-shot function and not shown. Assumption: levels at MIN are silent.",
